{"4952830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Torovo", "steam_appid": 4952830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the remnants of a forgotten industrial town in this handcrafted open world detective game. Take pictures and use them as evidence against the town’s residents. Track routines, plan your days ahead... and don't inhale the fumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GROUNDHOG DAY DETECTIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town of Torovo resets after three days. Every character has their own schedule in these 72 hours. Use the loop to your advantage to learn their routines and build your case. Gain different perspectives on the same events and experiment to get your desired outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SNAP EVIDENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/5c9b0f9217303b6dac84685e879e7d73.avif?t=1788170143\" width=102 height=79 /></span>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/f41f3edfa68eb833751137855af307be.avif?t=1788170143\" width=102 height=79 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/c0347c6a0b5088e977407e60d6def51d.avif?t=1788170143\" width=102 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Torovo don’t trust you. Explore the town and photograph anything you believe could be used as evidence. Show the townfolk your pictures and get them to talk. A leftover boot, a discarded note, a look on someone’s face, anything that catches your attention could help uncover the truth behind the crash… and Torovo itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEEP UP WITH SCHEDULES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/4db31d71b186a2c8f02491a08cacbc47.avif?t=1788170143\" width=78 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/fa2c8ae2cc4f439705a99f5815d3ba39.avif?t=1788170143\" width=109 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/e11d8fd1a53e36ee771ba5ff6c90489c.webp?t=1788170143\" width=61 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/6cc9e110f900ae526d0250a0e6736e53.avif?t=1788170143\" width=104 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/690bef450ae1cd6293084ed2173bb0bd.avif?t=1788170143\" width=120 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/316f2a902fce85655ef675927d80debe.avif?t=1788170143\" width=75 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resident follows their own schedule, changing locations throughout the day. The time and place you encounter someone will determine what kind of information they’re willing to share. Track their routines, uncover inconsistencies, and plan your investigation ahead of time to maximize your results.  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the remnants of a forgotten industrial town in this handcrafted open world detective game. Take pictures and use them as evidence against the town’s residents. Track routines, plan your days ahead... and don't inhale the fumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GROUNDHOG DAY DETECTIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town of Torovo resets after three days. Every character has their own schedule in these 72 hours. Use the loop to your advantage to learn their routines and build your case. Gain different perspectives on the same events and experiment to get your desired outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SNAP EVIDENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/5c9b0f9217303b6dac84685e879e7d73.avif?t=1788170143\" width=102 height=79 /></span>    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/f41f3edfa68eb833751137855af307be.avif?t=1788170143\" width=102 height=79 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4952830/extras/c0347c6a0b5088e977407e60d6def51d.avif?t=1788170143\" width=102 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Torovo don’t trust you. Explore the town and photograph anything you believe could be used as evidence. Show the townfolk your pictures and get them to talk. A leftover boot, a discarded note, a look on someone’s face, anything that catches your attention could help uncover the truth behind the crash… and Torovo itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEEP UP WITH SCHEDULES</strong></p